>> x := Into entsha.
>> y := Into entsha.
>> z := x.
Imveliso bhala: (x = z), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (x = y), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (x ≠ y), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (x ≠ z), umgca-omtsha.
>> m := Ixesha entsha unyaka: 2070, inyanga: 11.
>> n := m kopa.
Imveliso bhala: (m = n), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (m ≠ n), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (m iyafana: m), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (m iyafana: n), umgca-omtsha.
n inyanga: 12.
Imveliso bhala: (m ≠ n), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (m = n), umgca-omtsha.


